{"id":"f6c6ec86a875bee5","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-brauer-manin.md","title":"Brauer–Manin Pairing and Set","display":"df-brauer-manin — Brauer–Manin Pairing and Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-brauer-manin","aliases":["58-df-brauer-manin"],"display":"df-brauer-manin — Brauer–Manin Pairing and Set","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-brauer-manin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-brauer-manin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-brauer-manin — Brauer–Manin Pairing and Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,G,P,B\\in V\">\\(A,G,P,B\\in V\\)</span> (adelic-point set, cohomological Brauer-group set, places, and orthogonal subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\bigl((\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^P\\bigr)^{A\\times G}\">\\(\\ell\\in\\bigl((\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^P\\bigr)^{A\\times G}\\)</span> (local-invariant family) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}\\in(\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^{A\\times G}\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}\\in(\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^{A\\times G}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}\\)</span> (finiteness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrauerManinDatum}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{BrauerManinDatum}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (Brauer-Manin datum predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}manin}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BrauerManinDatum}_S(B,A,G,P,\\ell,\\mathrm{ev})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A,G,P,B\\in V\\land B\\subseteq A\n\\land\\ell\\in\\bigl((\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^P\\bigr)^{A\\times G}\n\\land\\mathrm{ev}\\in(\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^{A\\times G}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}\\!\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:\\ell(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)(v)\\neq0\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ev}(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)=\\sum_{v\\in P}\\ell(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)(v)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land B=\\{x\\in A:\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;(\\mathrm{ev}(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)=0)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}manin}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BrauerManinDatum}_S(B,A,G,P,\\ell,\\mathrm{ev})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A,G,P,B\\in V\\land B\\subseteq A\n\\land\\ell\\in\\bigl((\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^P\\bigr)^{A\\times G}\n\\land\\mathrm{ev}\\in(\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^{A\\times G}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}\\!\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:\\ell(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)(v)\\neq0\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ev}(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)=\\sum_{v\\in P}\\ell(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)(v)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land B=\\{x\\in A:\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;(\\mathrm{ev}(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)=0)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For a variety <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X/\\mathbb Q\">\\(X/\\mathbb Q\\)</span>, instantiate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=X(\\mathbb A_{\\mathbb Q})\">\\(A=X(\\mathbb A_{\\mathbb Q})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\mathrm{Br}(X)\">\\(G=\\mathrm{Br}(X)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(x,\\alpha)(v)=\\operatorname{inv}_v(\\alpha(x_v))\">\\(\\ell(x,\\alpha)(v)=\\operatorname{inv}_v(\\alpha(x_v))\\)</span>; then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is conventionally denoted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(\\mathbb A_{\\mathbb Q})^{\\mathrm{Br}}\">\\(X(\\mathbb A_{\\mathbb Q})^{\\mathrm{Br}}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The cohomological Brauer group of a variety is not identified with the incompatible field Brauer-group predicate for central simple algebras.</li>\n<li>The implication from rational points to nonempty Brauer–Manin set is a downstream theorem, not part of the definition.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Br}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Br}(X)\\)</span> fits into exact sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0 \\to \\mathrm{Br}(\\mathbb{Q}) \\to \\mathrm{Br}(X) \\to H^2(X, \\mathbb{G}_m) \\to 0\">\\(0 \\to \\mathrm{Br}(\\mathbb{Q}) \\to \\mathrm{Br}(X) \\to H^2(X, \\mathbb{G}_m) \\to 0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Colliot-Thélène: if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(\\mathbb{A}) \\neq \\emptyset\">\\(X(\\mathbb{A}) \\neq \\emptyset\\)</span> but <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(\\mathbb{A})^{\\mathrm{Br}} = \\emptyset\">\\(X(\\mathbb{A})^{\\mathrm{Br}} = \\emptyset\\)</span>, Brauer–Manin obstruction.</li>\n<li>Used to construct Châtelet surfaces violating Hasse principle.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Finite}$ (finiteness predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,G,P,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\in\\bigl((\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^P\\bigr)^{A\\times G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ev}\\in(\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^{A\\times G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrauerManinDatum}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}manin}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{BrauerManinDatum}_S(B,A,G,P,\\ell,\\mathrm{ev})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&A,G,P,B\\in V\\land B\\subseteq A\n\\land\\ell\\in\\bigl((\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^P\\bigr)^{A\\times G}\n\\land\\mathrm{ev}\\in(\\mathbb Q/\\mathbb Z)^{A\\times G}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Finite}\\!\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:\\ell(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)(v)\\neq0\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ev}(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)=\\sum_{v\\in P}\\ell(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)(v)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land B=\\{x\\in A:\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;(\\mathrm{ev}(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)=0)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X/\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"A=X(\\mathbb A_{\\mathbb Q})","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\mathrm{Br}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(x,\\alpha)(v)=\\operatorname{inv}_v(\\alpha(x_v))","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"X(\\mathbb A_{\\mathbb Q})^{\\mathrm{Br}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Br}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"0 \\to \\mathrm{Br}(\\mathbb{Q}) \\to \\mathrm{Br}(X) \\to H^2(X, \\mathbb{G}_m) \\to 0","display":false},{"tex":"X(\\mathbb{A}) \\neq \\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"X(\\mathbb{A})^{\\mathrm{Br}} = \\emptyset","display":false}],"bytes":2197,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-brauer-manin.md|58-df-brauer-manin]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}